video.description:
Bon Appétit meets Chef Lucas Sin to visit Mei Lai Wah in Manhattan’s Chinatown to see how the iconic Hong Kong-style bakery makes thousands of its famous roast pork buns. From pillowy fermented dough and rich char siu filling to the signature crackled pineapple topping,  discover the techniques that go into making this $3 NYC favorite.


